Error [E0109]: the bitwise and operator `&` works on Int (a whole number) only, but this has String (text) and String (text)
  --> tests/ui/sigil_bitand_operator_misuse.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     print("left" & "right")
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the bitwise and operator `&` is a whole-number operation (Int only)
 Fix: use whole numbers here
